[
  {
    "text": "Kiwis are the most underrated fruit",
    "start": 0.0,
    "end": 2.06
  },
  {
    "text": "for your health,",
    "start": 2.06,
    "end": 2.851
  },
  {
    "text": "and it's not even close,",
    "start": 2.851,
    "end": 4.347
  },
  {
    "text": "even if they look like",
    "start": 4.347,
    "end": 5.407
  },
  {
    "text": "a shaved tarantula abdomen.",
    "start": 5.407,
    "end": 7.144
  },
  {
    "text": "Let's start with its nutrition.",
    "start": 7.144,
    "end": 8.526
  },
  {
    "text": "Just two kiwis casually destroy",
    "start": 8.526,
    "end": 10.566
  },
  {
    "text": "an entire orange on vitamin C,",
    "start": 10.566,
    "end": 12.744
  },
  {
    "text": "although a 2v1 sounds a bit unfair.",
    "start": 12.744,
    "end": 15.43
  },
  {
    "text": "You can also get potassium",
    "start": 15.43,
    "end": 16.55
  },
  {
    "text": "so your heart doesn't glitch out,",
    "start": 16.55,
    "end": 18.166
  },
  {
    "text": "folate to build fresh DNA,",
    "start": 18.166,
    "end": 20.362
  },
  {
    "text": "vitamin K so a paper cut",
    "start": 20.362,
    "end": 21.682
  },
  {
    "text": "doesn't make you bleed out,",
    "start": 21.682,
    "end": 23.027
  },
  {
    "text": "and the weirdest one of all,",
    "start": 23.027,
    "end": 24.503
  },
  {
    "text": "vitamin E.",
    "start": 24.503,
    "end": 25.645
  },
  {
    "text": "Almost zero fruits have vitamin E",
    "start": 25.645,
    "end": 28.065
  },
  {
    "text": "because it's a fat-soluble antioxidant",
    "start": 28.065,
    "end": 30.005
  },
  {
    "text": "that protects your cell membranes",
    "start": 30.005,
    "end": 31.625
  },
  {
    "text": "from rusting to death,",
    "start": 31.625,
    "end": 32.896
  },
  {
    "text": "and fruit usually has no fat.",
    "start": 32.896,
    "end": 34.694
  },
  {
    "text": "But kiwis cheat the system",
    "start": 34.694,
    "end": 36.134
  },
  {
    "text": "by packing natural oils",
    "start": 36.134,
    "end": 37.574
  },
  {
    "text": "inside those tiny black seeds",
    "start": 37.574,
    "end": 39.254
  },
  {
    "text": "you crunch on.",
    "start": 39.254,
    "end": 40.792
  },
  {
    "text": "And then there's your tragic gut.",
    "start": 40.792,
    "end": 42.723
  },
  {
    "text": "Two kiwis give you about",
    "start": 42.723,
    "end": 43.843
  },
  {
    "text": "4 grams of fiber,",
    "start": 43.843,
    "end": 45.223
  },
  {
    "text": "which holds onto water",
    "start": 45.223,
    "end": 46.083
  },
  {
    "text": "like a sponge",
    "start": 46.083,
    "end": 46.763
  },
  {
    "text": "to sweep your intestines clean.",
    "start": 46.763,
    "end": 48.676
  },
  {
    "text": "And in a world where",
    "start": 48.676,
    "end": 49.416
  },
  {
    "text": "95% of people in the west",
    "start": 49.416,
    "end": 51.196
  },
  {
    "text": "are critically deficient in fiber",
    "start": 51.196,
    "end": 52.896
  },
  {
    "text": "because they survive on",
    "start": 52.896,
    "end": 54.016
  },
  {
    "text": "beige-processed garbage,",
    "start": 54.016,
    "end": 55.612
  },
  {
    "text": "this actually matters.",
    "start": 55.612,
    "end": 57.233
  },
  {
    "text": "In fact, a randomized controlled trial,",
    "start": 57.233,
    "end": 59.553
  },
  {
    "text": "the gold standard of clinical science,",
    "start": 59.553,
    "end": 61.427
  },
  {
    "text": "found that eating two kiwis a day",
    "start": 61.427,
    "end": 62.967
  },
  {
    "text": "significantly fixes constipation",
    "start": 62.967,
    "end": 64.907
  },
  {
    "text": "and abdominal comfort,",
    "start": 64.907,
    "end": 66.267
  },
  {
    "text": "so you don't spend 40 minutes",
    "start": 66.267,
    "end": 67.587
  },
  {
    "text": "on the toilet praying",
    "start": 67.587,
    "end": 68.647
  },
  {
    "text": "to a higher power.",
    "start": 68.647,
    "end": 70.267
  },
  {
    "text": "And sleep is the most underrated",
    "start": 70.267,
    "end": 72.027
  },
  {
    "text": "perk of all.",
    "start": 72.027,
    "end": 72.997
  },
  {
    "text": "Eating two kiwis before bed",
    "start": 72.997,
    "end": 74.477
  },
  {
    "text": "is clinically proven to upgrade",
    "start": 74.477,
    "end": 76.197
  },
  {
    "text": "your sleep quality by boosting serotonin.",
    "start": 76.197,
    "end": 78.537
  },
  {
    "text": "The brain chemical,",
    "start": 78.537,
    "end": 79.497
  },
  {
    "text": "your pineal gland,",
    "start": 79.497,
    "end": 80.337
  },
  {
    "text": "directly converts into melatonin,",
    "start": 80.337,
    "end": 82.317
  },
  {
    "text": "your main sleep hormone.",
    "start": 82.317,
    "end": 83.475
  },
  {
    "text": "So you actually pass out",
    "start": 83.475,
    "end": 84.731
  },
  {
    "text": "instead of staring at the ceiling",
    "start": 84.731,
    "end": 86.211
  },
  {
    "text": "until 3 am.",
    "start": 86.211,
    "end": 87.524
  },
  {
    "text": "Plus, two kiwis are one of",
    "start": 87.524,
    "end": 88.984
  },
  {
    "text": "the best pre-workout snacks on the planet.",
    "start": 88.984,
    "end": 91.063
  },
  {
    "text": "They give you fast-burning carbs,",
    "start": 91.063,
    "end": 92.843
  },
  {
    "text": "steady fiber,",
    "start": 92.843,
    "end": 93.703
  },
  {
    "text": "and a natural digestive enzyme",
    "start": 93.703,
    "end": 95.263
  },
  {
    "text": "called actinidin,",
    "start": 95.263,
    "end": 96.351
  },
  {
    "text": "which acts like chemical scissors",
    "start": 96.351,
    "end": 97.731
  },
  {
    "text": "in your stomach",
    "start": 97.731,
    "end": 98.411
  },
  {
    "text": "to chop up heavy proteins,",
    "start": 98.411,
    "end": 100.171
  },
  {
    "text": "so whatever meal you eat after training",
    "start": 100.171,
    "end": 101.991
  },
  {
    "text": "doesn't sit in your gut",
    "start": 101.991,
    "end": 103.151
  },
  {
    "text": "like a wet brick.",
    "start": 103.151,
    "end": 104.374
  },
  {
    "text": "They're dirt cheap,",
    "start": 104.374,
    "end": 105.434
  },
  {
    "text": "sitting in every grocery store,",
    "start": 105.434,
    "end": 107.214
  },
  {
    "text": "and nobody talks about them.",
    "start": 107.214,
    "end": 108.825
  },
  {
    "text": "Kiwis are massively underrated.",
    "start": 108.825,
    "end": 110.732
  },
  {
    "text": "Overrate them.",
    "start": 110.732,
    "end": 111.439
  },
  {
    "text": "Go eat the fuzzy green egg.",
    "start": 111.439,
    "end": 114.6
  }
]